<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Hypha third-party licenses</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; line-height: 1.45; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 72rem; padding: 0 1rem; }
    pre { background: #f4f4f4; border: 1px solid #ddd; overflow: auto; padding: 1rem; white-space: pre-wrap; }
    li { margin: .2rem 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Hypha third-party licenses</h1>
  <p>Generated with cargo-about 0.9.1 from Matrix Rust SDK commit <code>f4889ec898e77d8b8c9013adadd77f3d0901fc2d</code>, using the locked <code>matrix-sdk-ffi</code> dependency graph for <code>aarch64-apple-darwin</code>. This document preserves the package-specific license files and copyright text discovered in the exact dependency sources.</p>
  <p>The conservative package inventory and immutable source links are in <code>THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code>.</p>
  <h2>License overview</h2>
  <ul>
    {{#each overview}}
    <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}} packages)</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <h2>License and attribution text</h2>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section>
    {{#if first_of_kind}}<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>{{/if}}
    <h4>{{name}}</h4>
    <p>Used by:</p>
    <ul>
      {{#each used_by}}
      <li><code>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</code>{{#if crate.authors}} — package metadata authors: {{#each crate.authors}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}{{/if}}</li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
